<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-11T06:51:27.880Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:51:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to assault civilian targets in Plateau, killing three people at a mining site and injuring others, while also kidnapping five persons and shooting two in a separate community attack. Troops intercepted an assault by Berom militiamen on a Fulani settlement in Plateau, rescuing a gunshot victim, and Nigerian forces killed two ISWAP terrorists in Adamawa, recovering weapons. A video shows Ndume being assaulted by youths in Borno, and a bandit leader, Kachalla Bello, was reported killed in Katsina. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOMXBBRDhnTWJESXFYb0h6RjExMkhwY0libzBYOWQzZm41TG1vd1RTWWtzWlRJQ0kzU250ZlIxTVhvNnZHdUN2Z2xHdEl4TzFrZzdES1AzOHZ3OHpfYndMSXZfcHFmczFWdnRvNWU5bDNwSWo5dFMwLVMtdkk1Z0pFSFVNLWxjYmJRMC01emdCVko?oc=5&quot;&gt;Legit News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNNFZIUUpJR1piRnlZWTNxZHB0NHB3dzVlTGRhN1ZzWWxuUk9lVHhKUDdvRS01SHJhUDRZeFRTd1RGSjJVN25xM0dSSS1rV3RYUmY2X016b2w1c2xXZ2gzRmRzUjdkWDQ5YWN0U3BvMnpiem5hRzdLQ2ZFWVpsaVRUeFRvUGJCZHlCd21XVHplWElmUGk1UVhtdC13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPTHB6dnV2Q1NrZE5lVEgtMVhWS2RkekZzNExVLWFHYVBMWEpxYnkxWXIxcTR2YV9LRkQ2Z295SGRaNldQblhVZGF5ekxNSTlweFo3WEtyT2VOZm5VUVBTY1B2bEtDVkRfQnVZVmFud3ZMZUFmbVN2elMxUGJBaVlXNjluMUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goog